OL,3,GNEWSATwo murder arrests after man
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after a man was reportedly
OL,8,Fstabbed on Friday.
OL,10,FPolice said they were called to Orme
OL,11,FRoad in Newcastle-under-Lyme,
OL,12,FStaffordshire, shortly after 17:00 BST,
OL,13,Ffollowing a crash involving a red Ford
OL,14,FFiesta and grey Audi.
OL,16,FThe driver of the Fiesta, a man in his
OL,17,F20s, was taken to hospital where he
OL,18,Flater died, officers said. They added
OL,19,Fhis family was being supported by
OL,20,Fspecialist officers.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
