OL,3,GNEWSATwo murder arrests after man
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two men arrested, aged 20 and 22,
OL,7,Fboth from the Newcastle-under-Lyme
OL,8,Farea, remained in custody on Saturday,
OL,9,Faccording to police.
